insert into public.insights (id, title, summary, body, author_name, author_title, author_image, cover_image, published, published_at) values
(1, 'AI and technology in Audit', 'How AI-driven technology makes audits more risk-based, more data-driven and easier to repeat.', 'Audit is changing. Records grow every year, risks move faster than an annual sample can follow, and boards, regulators and investors expect evidence they can trace. At ASO INOVISION we help audit, risk and finance teams use AI-driven technology to make audits more risk-based, more data-driven and easier to repeat.

Our work starts with the data an organisation already holds: ledgers, payments, inventory records, site logs, access logs and documents. Instead of testing a sample and hoping it is representative, our models can examine whole populations of transactions and flag the items that do not fit the pattern, so audit time goes to the places where risk is highest.

## How we apply AI in audit

- **Risk-based planning.** Models rank transactions, branches, sites and processes by risk, so audit effort is aimed where it matters.
- **Whole-population testing.** Anomaly detection across complete data sets, with every flagged item traceable to its source record.
- **Document intelligence.** AI assistants read contracts, invoices and reports, extract key terms and match them to the records, with a person reviewing every decision.
- **Continuous monitoring.** Dashboards watch key controls between audits, so exceptions surface when they happen, not months later.
- **Physical evidence.** Access control and smart lock logs, and camera analytics where appropriate, link what happened on site to what the records say.

## Human judgment stays in charge

AI finds patterns. It does not sign an opinion. In every engagement an experienced person reviews each flagged item, and we document how each model was built, what data it used and how it performed, so the work can be explained to management, regulators and investors. ASO INOVISION provides technology and advisory support. Statutory audit opinions are issued only by licensed audit firms.

## Built for Nigerian conditions

Data in Nigerian organisations often sits in spreadsheets, scanned documents and mixed systems, and power and connectivity are not always dependable. We design for that reality, with data preparation, tools that tolerate poor connections and clear handover documentation, rather than assuming a perfect data warehouse.

## How an engagement runs

We follow the same four moves every time: diagnose the workflow and the data, prototype against real records, deploy with monitoring, and scale with training and handover. Your team keeps the tools and the knowledge when we leave.

If your organisation wants audits that are faster to run and easier to defend, we would be glad to talk.', '', 'Partner and Head, Technology', 'builtin:pa', 'builtin:ai', true, '2026-11-02T09:00:00+00:00'),
(2, 'From problem to production, in four moves', 'The sequence we follow on every engagement, and why skipping a step is where deployed systems break.', 'The same sequence every time, because skipping a step is where deployed systems usually break.

## 1. Diagnose

We study the workflow, the data and the failure modes before touching a model or a lock: the site, the shop floor, the farm.

## 2. Prototype

A working system against real conditions, validated with the people who will use it.

## 3. Deploy

Shipped and installed, software, hardware or both, with monitoring so performance is measured, not assumed.

## 4. Scale

Maintenance, retraining and handover, so the system keeps working as your sites, users and volume grow.', '', 'ASO INOVISION', '', '', true, '2026-11-01T09:00:00+00:00'),
(3, 'Built local, held to a global bar', 'Why one accountable team beats a chain of vendors, and how we document our work.', 'Three commitments shape every engagement, whatever the sector.

## One accountable team

No hand-off between a model vendor, a hardware installer and an app developer. One team trains the model, installs the lock and stands behind both.

## Context before code

We build for how a Lagos site, shop or farm actually operates, with intermittent power and connectivity and mixed devices, not a lab environment.

## Documentation that travels

Architecture, specs and handover documents written to a standard that holds up to international due diligence and investor review.', '', 'ASO INOVISION', '', '', true, '2026-10-31T09:00:00+00:00');

insert into public.jobs (id, title, dept, job_type, location, short, overview, responsibilities, requirements, is_intern, "open", sort) values
(1, 'AI/ML Engineer — Computer Vision', 'Engineering', 'Full-time', 'Lagos', 'Build and train the detection and prediction models behind our construction, retail, agritech and access-control products.', 'You will build and train the detection and prediction models at the core of our products, and take them from notebook to production on real sites.', '["Collect, label and curate image and video data from client sites", "Train and evaluate object detection, classification and prediction models", "Optimise models for edge devices and unreliable connectivity", "Work with backend and field teams to deploy, monitor and retrain models", "Document datasets, experiments and results to a standard that holds up to review"]'::jsonb, '["Degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Statistics or a related field, or equivalent experience", "2 to 5 years of experience building and deploying computer vision or machine learning models", "Hands-on experience with Python, PyTorch or TensorFlow, and OpenCV", "Experience training and evaluating computer vision models", "Understanding of deployment: Docker, REST APIs and model serving", "Experience with edge deployment (Jetson, TFLite, ONNX) is an advantage", "Completed the NYSC scheme (discharge or exemption certificate)", "Proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace", "Strong written and verbal communication skills", "Ability to work under pressure, meet deadlines and work well in a team", "Honesty and integrity, with two professional referees who can vouch for you", "Based in Lagos, or willing to work from our Lagos office"]'::jsonb, false, true, 10),
(2, 'Backend Engineer — APIs & Infrastructure', 'Engineering', 'Full-time', 'Lagos', 'Own the APIs, data pipelines and deployment infrastructure that keep every product running in production.', 'You will own the APIs, data pipelines and deployment infrastructure that keep every product running in production.', '["Design and build REST APIs and services for our products", "Build and maintain data pipelines from cameras, sensors and devices", "Manage cloud infrastructure, CI/CD and monitoring", "Secure systems with authentication, logging and access controls", "Write architecture and handover documentation"]'::jsonb, '["Degree in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent experience", "2 to 5 years of experience building and running backend services in production", "Strong skills in Python, Node.js or a similar language", "Experience with PostgreSQL and a cloud platform", "Familiarity with Docker, CI/CD and Linux", "Experience designing for intermittent connectivity is an advantage", "Completed the NYSC scheme (discharge or exemption certificate)", "Proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace", "Strong written and verbal communication skills", "Ability to work under pressure, meet deadlines and work well in a team", "Honesty and integrity, with two professional referees who can vouch for you", "Based in Lagos, or willing to work from our Lagos office"]'::jsonb, false, true, 20),
(3, 'Frontend / Mobile Developer', 'Engineering', 'Full-time', 'Lagos', 'Build the web dashboards and mobile apps our clients — from farmers to facility managers — actually touch every day.', 'You will build the web dashboards and mobile apps our clients use every day, from farmers to facility managers.', '["Build responsive dashboards and mobile apps", "Turn designs and client feedback into polished interfaces", "Integrate with our APIs and handle errors gracefully", "Optimise for low bandwidth and a wide range of devices", "Test usability with real users and improve what you find"]'::jsonb, '["Experience with React, React Native or Flutter", "2 to 5 years of experience building web or mobile applications", "Solid HTML, CSS and JavaScript or TypeScript", "Care for responsive design and accessibility", "Comfortable with Git and code review", "A portfolio of web or mobile work you can show us", "Completed the NYSC scheme (discharge or exemption certificate)", "Proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace", "Strong written and verbal communication skills", "Ability to work under pressure, meet deadlines and work well in a team", "Honesty and integrity, with two professional referees who can vouch for you", "Based in Lagos, or willing to work from our Lagos office"]'::jsonb, false, true, 30),
(4, 'Access Control & Smart Lock Installation Technician', 'Field / Hardware', 'Full-time', 'Lagos (field-based)', 'Install and maintain access control and smart lock hardware on client sites across Lagos — offices, estates, construction sites and shops.', 'You will install and maintain access control and smart lock hardware on client sites across Lagos, from offices and estates to construction sites and shops.', '["Install and commission access control readers, controllers and smart locks", "Wire, configure and test systems on site", "Maintain and repair installed systems", "Document each installation and train client staff to use it", "Follow site safety rules and keep client sites tidy"]'::jsonb, '["OND, HND or B.Eng in Electrical, Electronics or a related field, or equivalent trade experience", "2 to 5 years of experience installing and maintaining electronic security, access control or similar systems", "Hands-on experience with low-voltage wiring and electronic hardware", "Willingness to travel across Lagos for site work", "Good safety habits and a professional manner with clients", "Experience with biometric or card access systems is an advantage", "Completed the NYSC scheme (discharge or exemption certificate)", "Proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace", "Strong written and verbal communication skills", "Ability to work under pressure, meet deadlines and work well in a team", "Honesty and integrity, with two professional referees who can vouch for you", "Based in Lagos, or willing to work from our Lagos office"]'::jsonb, false, true, 40),
(5, 'Business Development Lead — SMEs & Enterprise', 'Sales', 'Full-time', 'Lagos', 'Bring in and manage client relationships across construction, retail, SME and enterprise accounts.', 'You will bring in and manage client relationships across construction, retail, SME and enterprise accounts.', '["Identify and win new clients in our target sectors", "Manage accounts and keep clients happy after delivery", "Prepare proposals and quotations with the engineering team", "Report on pipeline, targets and market feedback", "Represent ASO INOVISION at client meetings and events"]'::jsonb, '["Understanding of technology solutions and how to explain them simply", "2 to 5 years of experience in B2B sales or business development", "Excellent communication and negotiation skills", "Network in construction, retail, SME or enterprise sectors in Lagos is an advantage", "Ability to work to targets", "Completed the NYSC scheme (discharge or exemption certificate)", "Proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace", "Strong written and verbal communication skills", "Ability to work under pressure, meet deadlines and work well in a team", "Honesty and integrity, with two professional referees who can vouch for you", "Based in Lagos, or willing to work from our Lagos office"]'::jsonb, false, true, 50),
(6, 'Consulting & Strategy Associate', 'Advisory', 'Full-time / Contract', 'Lagos', 'Support AI readiness assessments and digital transformation roadmaps for client leadership teams.', 'You will support AI readiness assessments and digital transformation roadmaps for client leadership teams.', '["Support AI readiness assessments for clients", "Help build digital transformation roadmaps", "Research industries and benchmark practices", "Prepare reports and presentations for leadership teams", "Help run workshops with client staff"]'::jsonb, '["Degree in business, economics, engineering, computer science or a related field", "2 to 5 years of experience in consulting, strategy, analytics or a related advisory role", "Strong analytical and writing skills", "Familiarity with data and AI concepts", "Comfort presenting to senior people", "Good command of spreadsheets and presentation tools", "Completed the NYSC scheme (discharge or exemption certificate)", "Proficiency in Microsoft Office or Google Workspace", "Strong written and verbal communication skills", "Ability to work under pressure, meet deadlines and work well in a team", "Honesty and integrity, with two professional referees who can vouch for you", "Based in Lagos, or willing to work from our Lagos office"]'::jsonb, false, true, 60),
(7, 'Internship Programme', 'Internship', 'Internship', 'Lagos', 'We employ interns from Agricultural Science related departments, Computer Science, Computer Engineering and Human Resources related departments, currently pursuing a B.Sc., OND or HND.', 'We take interns from Agricultural Science related departments, Computer Science, Computer Engineering, and Human Resources related departments. You must currently be pursuing a B.Sc., OND or HND.', '["Support teams on real projects, such as AgriTech field data, software, AI and hardware work, or people operations", "Learn our tools, processes and engineering standards", "Help document work and prepare handover material", "Share what you learn with the team"]'::jsonb, '["Currently pursuing a B.Sc., OND or HND", "Studying Agricultural Science (or related), Computer Science, Computer Engineering, or Human Resources (or related)", "Available for the full internship period, which you tell us in your application", "Eagerness to learn and take feedback", "Reliable, punctual and respectful of client sites", "Letter of introduction from your institution (SIWES or industrial training), where applicable", "Basic computer skills (Microsoft Office or Google Workspace) and good communication"]'::jsonb, true, true, 70);

